---

## import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

<Layout title="Opportunity Platform">
    <section class="flex flex-col items-center justify-center text-center py-20 sm:py-28">

```
    <div class="mb-6">
        <span class="px-4 py-2 text-sm font-bold rounded-full bg-white/10 border border-white/20">
            Opportunities built around you
        </span>
    </div>

    <h1 class="text-5xl sm:text-6xl font-extrabold tracking-tight mb-6">
        Find opportunities.<br />
        Build your future.
    </h1>

    <p class="max-w-2xl text-lg sm:text-xl text-white/80 mb-10">
        Discover scholarships, fellowships, postdoctoral positions,
        research opportunities, grants, and other opportunities matched
        to your goals.
    </p>

    <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4">
        <a
            href="/opportunities"
            class="btn btn-lg btn-primary"
        >
            Explore Opportunities
        </a>

        <a
            href="/login"
            class="btn btn-lg btn-outline text-white"
        >
            Continue with Google
        </a>
    </div>

</section>

<section class="pb-20">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">

        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white/10 border border-white/10">
            <div class="text-3xl mb-4">🔎</div>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">Discover</h2>
            <p class="text-white/70">
                Find opportunities across countries, institutions,
                disciplines, and academic levels.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white/10 border border-white/10">
            <div class="text-3xl mb-4">⭐</div>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">Save</h2>
            <p class="text-white/70">
                Keep interesting opportunities in one place so you
                don't lose track of them.
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="p-6 rounded-2xl bg-white/10 border border-white/10">
            <div class="text-3xl mb-4">📋</div>
            <h2 class="text-xl font-bold mb-2">Track</h2>
            <p class="text-white/70">
                Track applications, deadlines, documents, and outcomes
                from your personal dashboard.
            </p>
        </div>

    </div>
</section>
```

</Layout>
